Dear  Wycliff and Qunita,

Thank you for giving me an opportunity.

Further to our conversation in regard to contracting out NSSF Tier 2, the p=
rocedure for the same requires you  to do the following;

1.       Complete Form CR 1  as attached
2.       Submit the Employer resolution to contract out as per attached tem=
plate. This should be on company letterhead
3.       Attach Employer undertaking as per template provided
4.       Attach Copy of Notice by Employer to the employees  as per templat=
e attached
5.       List of employees and their NSSF numbers.

Note that since Novustell Travel will be contracting out to The Kenyan Alli=
ance Insurance Umbrella retirement benefits scheme, this organization requi=
res to be onboarded to this scheme. This shall require the following;

1.       Employer to Sign Deed of Adherence to the KAI Umbrella scheme
2.       Employer to complete master proposal form

For any clarifications or assistance, please feel free to contact us and we=
 look forward to doing business with you.


Kind Regards

